    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RE/MAX Property Specialists are delighted to present No. 26 Williamstown Glen to the market, a bright and well-presented three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached home in this established residential development off the Williamstown Road.\r\n\r\nThe property offers spacious and practical accommodation over two floors, with an excellent layout suited to both family living and entertaining. The home benefits from gas-fired central heating and timber flooring throughout much of the accommodation.\r\n\r\nOn entering the home, a welcoming entrance hall leads through to a generous sitting room featuring a large bay window which fills the room with natural light, timber flooring and an attractive fireplace creating a comfortable focal point. Double doors connect the sitting room with the kitchen and dining area to the rear.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen/dining room provides an excellent everyday living space, with ample fitted cabinetry, generous worktop space and plenty of room for a full-size dining table. Large glazed doors from the dining area open directly onto the rear garden, creating a natural connection between the indoor and outdoor spaces. A separate utility room and guest WC complete the ground-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, all benefiting from timber flooring. The principal bedroom is particularly spacious and benefits from its own ensuite shower room. The remaining bedrooms are served by a family bathroom fitted with a bath and overhead shower.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property enjoys a private driveway providing off-street parking together with a lawned front garden. Gated side access leads to a generous enclosed rear garden, predominantly laid in lawn and offering excellent space for children, outdoor dining or further landscaping.\r\n\r\nWilliamstown Glen enjoys a highly convenient location on the Williamstown Road, within easy reach of University Hospital Waterford, Ardkeen Stores and the extensive range of shops, services and amenities available throughout the Ardkeen and Dunmore Road area. Waterford City Centre is also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nNo. 26 combines comfortable living accommodation, three bedrooms, excellent outdoor space and private parking, making it an appealing opportunity for first-time buyers, families or those looking to move to this popular part of Waterford.\r\n\r\nThese particulars do not constitute an offer or contract, and whilst every effort has been made in preparing all descriptions, dimensions, maps, and plans, these details should not be relied upon as fact. Dimensions / Illustrations are for guideline purposes only and not to scale. RE/MAX Property Specialists - Team fogarty will not hold itself responsible for any inaccuracies contained therein"
      },
      {
